Package: zu
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Zexolver <Zexolver@disroot.org>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Zexolver/zu
Description: Zex's Universal: one front-end for every package manager
 zu is a pure-Rust wrapper that tries the platform's own package manager
 first (apt here), then falls back through others in a configurable
 order. Priority and per-package overrides live in /etc/zu, editable
 per-user under ~/.config/zu.
 .
 This package ships a statically linked (musl) binary, so it has no
 runtime library dependencies.
